  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e787bb2f794a6a4695134e4583867ae, type: 3}
  m_Name: Orb
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Character
  charName: Eternity
  characterSprite: {fileID: 2816740430268824205, guid: db9b608722c4b6c41b021dd058fcbd3a, type: 3}
  lines:
  - Look up there!
  - Do you see it? A pink orb.
  - "These little things tend to act as keys. They\u2019re meant to be carried to
    statues of matching colour, when placed correctly, they awaken certain changes
    in the world."
  - "Platforms may appear and sometimes\u2026 the ground itself becomes something
    else entirely. Slippery. Unstable. Useful, if you\u2019re quick enough."
  - You can only hold one object at a time, of course.
  - "So if you need to interact with the key, you\u2019ll have to let go of what
    you\u2019re carrying. Bind the Drop action to a key and use it when necessary."
  - "Just\u2026 be careful."
  - The soul weakens when it is left unattended. The longer you carry on without
    it, the more it fades.
  - "So don\u2019t be careless.\r\nReturn quickly.\r\n"
  - Go on.
  - Godspeed.
